<title>USA: Campbell Soup to launch debt offering.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup to launch debt offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co will launch a corporate debt offering on Wednesday, said lead underwriter Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>&quot;The Campbell Soup deal will be launched today,&quot; a high-grade syndicate source at Goldman said.</p>
<p>The underwriter had no further commment on the details of the offering.</p>
<p>However, market sources said the deal is expected to consist of $300 million in 10-year debt.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
